# analysis/eigen/section_thickness/K741TH2 written in inp: two cantilever plates
# of different thickness share one material, and the eigenvalues equal those of
# K741TH2.
# The temperature column of *ELASTIC is not a material value, so it must not
# be read as the thickness of the mass matrix.
!SOLUTION, TYPE=EIGEN
!EIGEN
 6, 1.0E-8, 60
!BOUNDARY
 FIX, 1, 6, 0.0
!SOLVER, METHOD=CG, PRECOND=3, ITERLOG=NO, TIMELOG=NO
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
!WRITE, RESULT
!END
